[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3224712406","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109988#issuecomment-3224712406","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109988","id":3224712406,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ANTTW","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-26T15:38:05Z","updated_at":"2025-08-27T11:50:21Z","body":"Please provide an MRP to make this easier to test and fix:\n- A small Godot project which reproduces the issue, with no unnecessary files included. Be sure to not include the `.godot` folder in the archive (but keep `project.godot`).\n- Having an MRP is very important for contributors to be able to reproduce the bug in the same way that you are experiencing it. When testing a potential fix for the issue, contributors will use the MRP to validate that the fix is working as intended.\n- Drag and drop a ZIP archive to upload it (max 10 MB). **Do not select another field until the project is done uploading.**\n- **Note for C# users:** If your issue is *not* C#-specific, please upload a minimal reproduction project written in GDScript. This will make it easier for contributors to reproduce the issue locally as not everyone has a .NET setup available. \n\nThis doesn't really list any steps for how to reproduce this, so please update the steps and add an MRP","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3224712406/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"resolved"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3227874506","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109988#issuecomment-3227874506","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109988","id":3227874506,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7AZXTK","user":{"login":"Rindbee","id":30386067,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzg2MDY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30386067?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee","html_url":"https://github.com/Rindbee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-27T11:48:45Z","updated_at":"2025-08-27T11:49:25Z","body":"It seems that when you import the `json` file, you create a new `Resource` and fill it with data, and then save the data in the `Resource` to the `tres` file through `ResourceSaver.save()`.\n\nCalling `ResourceSaver.save()` to save a resource in the editor automatically calls `EditorFileSystem::update_files()`, which updates the timestamp of the file in `.godot/editor/filesystem_cache10`, but does not trigger a reload of the Resource instance loaded from that file.\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/b267c2fc6c229246bda4cfe2023c3886c2f4b033/core/io/resource_saver.cpp#L145-L147\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/b267c2fc6c229246bda4cfe2023c3886c2f4b033/editor/file_system/editor_file_system.cpp#L2466\n\nThe editor does not consider whether saving different Resource instances to the same path should reload other Resource instances.\n\nAs a workaround: try to load the Resource instance from the path, creating a new one only if the instance is invalid.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3227874506/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3233323808","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109988#issuecomment-3233323808","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109988","id":3233323808,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7AuJsg","user":{"login":"Rindbee","id":30386067,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzg2MDY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30386067?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee","html_url":"https://github.com/Rindbee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-28T12:34:28Z","updated_at":"2025-08-28T12:36:07Z","body":"4.x version of #30302.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3233323808/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]